---
title: Background State Sync Loop
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant CA as Cluster Aggregator
    participant CR as Cache Registry
    participant PP as Performance Profiler
    participant SS as State Sync<br/>(background)
    participant WS as World State<br/>(in-memory)

    Note over SS,WS: Continuous synchronization<br/>keeps World State fresh

    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
        Note over CA,SS: Watch Stream (continuous)

        loop On every cluster event
            CA->>SS: PodEvent(pod-xyz, Running, node-5)
            SS->>WS: upsert_replica(pod-xyz, node-5, Running)

            CA->>SS: NodeEvent(node-3, GPUs: 4 allocated)
            SS->>WS: update_node(node-3, allocated=4)
        end
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        Note over CA,SS: vLLM Metrics (every 10s)

        SS->>CA: get_vllm_metrics()
        CA-->>SS: vLLMMetrics per app:<br/>app-X: {queue=3, kv_cache=0.6, batch=0.7}<br/>app-Y: {queue=12, kv_cache=0.9, batch=0.85}
        SS->>WS: update_vllm_metrics(metrics)

        Note over WS: High queue/cache pressure<br/>triggers scaling evaluation
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over CR,SS: Cache Registry Poll (every 30s)

        SS->>CR: get_cache_state()
        CR-->>SS: CacheState (tiered):<br/>model-A: [{node-1, LOCAL_NVME}, {node-5, GPU_MEMORY}]<br/>model-B: [{cluster-1, CLUSTER_STORAGE}]
        SS->>WS: update_cache_locations(cache_state)
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note over PP,SS: Performance Profiles (every 5m)

        SS->>PP: get_performance_profiles()
        PP-->>SS: Profiles:<br/>app-X: {tps=100, ttft=50ms, cold=60s}<br/>app-Y: {tps=80, ttft=70ms, cold=45s}
        SS->>WS: update_profiles(profiles)
    end

    rect rgb(250, 240, 255)
        Note over CA,SS: Full Reconcile (every 5m)

        SS->>CA: get_full_cluster_state()
        CA-->>SS: FullState: all clusters, nodes, pods
        SS->>WS: reconcile_all(full_state)

        Note over WS: Detect and fix any drift<br/>between World State and reality
    end
